					<description><![CDATA[For those who cannot attend the AMSAT-UK Colloquium on October 10-11 the talks will be streamed live on the AMSAT-UK YouTube Channel from 9:15 AM BST (08:15 GMT). Saturday 10th http://youtube.com/live/WQy0CXqjp3M Sunday 11th https://youtube.com/live/CS6i-xeDm7o The schedule of AMSAT-UK talks can be seen in the RSGB Convention programme  listings for Saturday and Sunday, see the Lecture &#8230; &#8230; <a href="https://amsat-uk.org/2026/10/09/live-stream-of-amsat-uk-colloquium-talks-2/">Continue reading <span class="meta-nav">&#8594;</span></a>]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://amsat-uk.org/wp-content/uploads/2013/03/amsat-uk_bevelled_logo.jpg"><img data-attachment-id="14521" data-permalink="https://amsat-uk.org/2013/02/26/radio-amateurs-asked-to-collect-strand-1-telemetry-data/amsat-uk_bevelled_logo/" data-orig-file="https://amsat-uk.org/wp-content/uploads/2013/03/amsat-uk_bevelled_logo.jpg" data-orig-size="570,552" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="AMSAT-UK_Bevelled_Logo" data-image-description="&lt;p&gt;AMSAT-UK Logo&lt;/p&gt;
